    {
      "title": "繞 $x$ 軸",
      "prompt": "$y=x$ 與 $y=x^2$ 所圍區域繞 $x$ 軸旋轉，求體積。",
      "problemId": "cx-rev-003",
      "steps": [
        "交點 $x=0$、1。代 $x=\\frac{1}{2}$：$x=\\frac{1}{2}>\\frac{1}{4}=x^2$，$y=x$ 離 $x$ 軸較遠。",
        "$R=x$，$r=x^2$。$A(x)=\\pi(x^2-x^4)$。",
        "$V=\\pi\\int_0^1(x^2-x^4)\\,dx=\\pi\\left(\\frac{1}{3}-\\frac{1}{5}\\right)=\\frac{2\\pi}{15}$。"
      ],
      "answer": "$\\frac{2\\pi}{15}$",
      "claim": "INT(pi*(x^2-x^4), 0, 1) == 2*pi/15"
    },
    {
      "title": "繞水平線 $y=1$",
      "prompt": "區域 $R$ 由 $y=2x-x^2$ 與 $x$ 軸圍成，繞直線 $y=1$ 旋轉，求體積。",
      "problemId": "lec-09-q2d",
      "steps": [
        "區域是 $0\\le x\\le 2$，曲線最高點 $(1,1)$ 剛好碰到軸，整個區域在 $y=1$ 下方。",
        "從軸往下量：$x$ 軸（$y=0$）到軸的距離是 1，比較遠，$R=1$；曲線到軸的距離是 $1-(2x-x^2)=(1-x)^2$，$r=(1-x)^2$。",
        "$V=\\pi\\int_0^2(1^2-(1-x)^4)\\,dx$。令 $u=1-x$，$\\int_0^2(1-x)^4\\,dx=\\int_{-1}^1 u^4\\,du=\\frac{2}{5}$。",
        "$V=\\pi\\left(2-\\frac{2}{5}\\right)=\\frac{8\\pi}{5}$。"
      ],
      "answer": "$\\frac{8\\pi}{5}$",
      "claim": "INT((1-x)^4, 0, 2) == 2/5 ;; INT(pi*(1-(1-(2x-x^2))^2), 0, 2) == 8*pi/5"
    },
    {
      "title": "繞 $y$ 軸，對 $y$ 積分",
      "prompt": "$y=x$ 與 $y=x^2$ 所圍區域繞 $y$ 軸旋轉，求體積。",
      "steps": [
        "水平切，$y$ 從 0 到 1。把兩條邊界寫成 $x$：直線 $x=y$，拋物線 $x=\\sqrt{y}$。",
        "代 $y=\\frac{1}{4}$：$\\sqrt{y}=\\frac{1}{2}>\\frac{1}{4}=y$，拋物線離 $y$ 軸較遠。$R=\\sqrt{y}$，$r=y$。",
        "$V=\\pi\\int_0^1((\\sqrt{y})^2-y^2)\\,dy=\\pi\\int_0^1(y-y^2)\\,dy=\\pi\\left(\\frac{1}{2}-\\frac{1}{3}\\right)=\\frac{\\pi}{6}$。"
      ],
      "answer": "$\\frac{\\pi}{6}$",
      "claim": "INT(pi*(y-y^2), 0, 1) == pi/6"
    }
